    "id": "player-likeness-art",
    "kind": "sprite",
    "what": "The doubles should look like the caster: draw the player's own sprite (current gear) with a pale, slightly translucent tint and a 2px outline jitter, in place of a monster family. Needed by Living Double (a creature summon, today drawn as the umbral shade), Standing Reflection (a turret, today a generic turret), Wall of Doubles (a barrier_block wall, today the generic wall: 5-7 player copies standing shoulder to shoulder, looping idle sway, ~32px apart). Mechanic side: activeSummon / barrierWall would read a `drawAs: 'caster'` pin."
