    "what": "A poured stream of murky liquid as a beam: brown-green fen-water (Fouled Torrent, 32 px) or a twisted rope of green venom and brown water (Twinned Spew, 30 px), up to 8 tiles from the caster's mouth; 3-frame gush start, 4-frame churning body loop, 3-frame splash impact (stand-in: fx5 beammid)."
