  "gaps": [
   {
    "id": "beast-form",
    "kind": "mechanic",
    "what": "Transform kinds for animal and material bodies (a great hart, a living statue, an ursine brute with its own attack set and stat profile, a sprite swap). The transform template carries only the three canon kinds (speciousSorcerer / counterfeitCombatant / instantAdept), so Ursine Shape, Lupine Shape and Shape of the Grey Owl ride those and Hart Shape and Living Statue wait."
   },
   {
    "id": "polymorph-hostile",
    "kind": "mechanic",
    "what": "Polymorph: turn an enemy into a harmless critter for a few seconds (sprite swap, attacks and abilities off, speed cut, broken by damage past a threshold). [Toad-Shaped] stands in as a silence; Toad for a Moment is an ability lock; Mass Polymorph waits."
   },
   {
    "id": "size-change",
    "kind": "mechanic",
    "what": "Grow or shrink a body: sprite scale, reach, hit radius and knockback weight change for a while (yourself or a target). Sudden Bulk, Lengthening Arm, Long-Armed affinities, Shape of a Small Thing and Small and Quick ship on their nearest templates without the visible change."
   },
   {
    "id": "armour-thicken",
    "kind": "mechanic",
    "what": "Conjured armour that grows a step each time you are struck (to a cap) and resets out of combat. Riders fire on events; none grows the armour itself."
   },
   {
    "id": "shapeshift-fx",
    "kind": "animation",
    "what": "A shape-change burst on the caster: a swirl of fur, feathers and scales that wraps the body and blows away, ~64x64px, one-shot ~0.5s. For the three live transforms, Slip the Old Shape, Molt Everything Off, Moth Then Yourself, Swallow's Way Home and Made Beast (stand-ins: fx2 voidburst, puff)."
   },
   {
    "id": "petrify-fx",
    "kind": "animation",
    "what": "Petrification: a grey stone crust climbing a body from the feet up, ~32x48px, one-shot ~0.6s, then a held grey tint while [Turned to Statue] lasts and a one-shot ~0.3s crumble when it breaks. For Petrifying Lance, Line of Petrification, Basilisk Stare, Petrifying Pulse, Creeping Grey, Grey-Fisted Blow, Statue Plate, the statue summons and payoffs (stand-ins: fx cracks, fx3 circle4)."
   },
   {
    "id": "transmute-beam-art",
    "kind": "animation",
    "what": "A transmutation beam: a ~24px line that shimmers violet at the source and turns grey (petrify) or gold (gilding) along its length, looping while it holds, ~0.15s grow-in. For Line of Petrification, Transmuting Ray and Gold-Leaf Beam (stand-ins: fx5 beammid, beamthin)."
   },
   {
    "id": "quill-flight",
    "kind": "sprite",
    "what": "A quill projectile, ~14x3px, black-and-white banded, 2-frame spin, for Loosed Quill, Quill Spray, Hail of Quills, Porcupine Coat, the quill stump, Quill Javelins and Quill Coat (stand-in: fx5 needlerain / the lance flight)."
   },
   {
    "id": "antler-wall-art",
    "kind": "animation",
    "what": "barrier walls draw the generic wall; a hedge of antlers and horns punching up out of the ground (~32px thick, ~0.3s rise, held while it stands) would let Hedge of Horns and Thicket of Antlers look like what they are."
   },
   {
    "id": "toad-sprite",
    "kind": "sprite",
    "what": "The polymorph critter: a small green toad, ~16x16px, 4-frame idle hop and a 2-frame croak, drawn over a polymorphed enemy for Toad for a Moment and Mass Polymorph."
   },
   {
    "id": "player-form-sprites",
    "kind": "sprite",
    "what": "Player bodies for the three live transforms: an ursine brute (~48x48), a lupine runner (~40x32) and a great grey owl (~40x40), each with idle, move and one attack loop, swapped in for the transform's duration."
   },
   {
    "id": "rider-disguise",
    "kind": "mechanic",
    "what": "Mask of Another Face: a carried trinket that, once a minute, puts on the shape of the last enemy you killed for a few seconds; enemies of that kind ignore you until you strike. Riders lay, deal, heal and buff; none changes how enemies see you."
   }
  ]
