    "what": "A transform kind for the wendigo body (antlered, gaunt, towering; a killing-frost field, life on hit, immunity to frost conditions, a fire weakness while it lasts). The transform template only carries canon kinds; a Wendigo kit that rolls a transform keeps a non-transform buff from its sheet instead."
